    "body": "<!-- relay-run-log -->\n**Relay run log** — issue #219\n\n- 2026-09-17 13:25Z — Relay picked up this issue for a BB worker run.\n- 2026-09-17 15:15Z — Relay BB run pushed an update. Pull request: #429 Tokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000 Pushed branch `bb/relay-219-implementation-audit-fixes-17-23-imple-thr_tb6kwqv39b` to origin. ## Summary Implements issue #219: the neutral generic application service (`packages/application/src/genericApplicationService.ts`) as the sole `GenericApplicationPort` implementation over `packages/data`'s choke-point facade, and rebases the REST adapter (`services/semprec-api`) onto `GENERIC_OPERATION_BINDINGS`. Key changes: - `semprec-api` instantiates the generic application service once in its composition root and routes every generic REST operation through the binding catalog via `dispatchGenericOperation`. - The relation route `/api/items/:id/relations/:propertyKey/:targetItemId` keeps its own route-only propertyKey resolution: `404 not_found` when no property matches, `409 validation_failed` when the key is ambiguous across multiple relation properties. - Wired up the three generic operations that previously had no REST route (`view.list`, `view.get`, `viewItem.reorder`) via `GET /api/views`, `GET /api/views/:id`, and `PATCH /api/views/:id/items/:itemId`. - Added `POST /api/databases/:id/restore`, property list/get exposure, and the evolved `{code, details}` error union including `database_archived`. - Added a parameterized contract test (`genericOperationsContract.test.ts`) that exercises all 28 generic operations over REST, with a completeness assertion against the operation catalog so it can't silently drift stale. - Fixed a documentation/coverage gap: `database.restore` existed as a route but was missing from `routeMatrix.ts` and the choke-point write-boundary test's handler mapping. Verification: `pnpm run verify` passed in both `backend/` (lint, format, build, 1234 unit tests, boundary checks, integration tests, e2e tests) and `web/` (lint, format, build, 187 tests) — all run synchronously this session with no failures. Relay-Step-Status: pass\n- 2026-09-17 16:07Z — Relay BB run pushed an update. Pull request: #429 Tokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000 Pushed to `bb/relay-219-implementation-audit-fixes-17-23-imple-thr_tb6kwqv39b`. This push adds one commit addressing the three review findings from the prior audit round on issue #219: - **Raw property list/get routes**: `GET /api/properties?databaseId=` and `GET /api/properties/:id` now return the authoritative raw `Property`/`Property[]` rows (including `config`), per the issue's explicit requirement that agents be able to discover relation property ids. The pre-existing, frontend-consumed `GET /api/databases/:id/properties` catalog route is untouched. - **TOCTOU fix**: `patchProperty`'s relation type/config guard now runs inside `chokePoint.updateProperty`'s own transaction, against the row that same transaction fetches, closing the race window a concurrent type change could previously slip through. - **Missing ADR**: added `docs/adr/2026-09-17-generic-application-service-port.md` documenting the `GenericApplicationPort` application-service layer's ownership boundaries and per-`Pool` construction contract. Also added regression tests for `empty_patch`, `relation_definition_required` (type, config, and allowed rename), and the two new raw property routes. Both `backend/` and `web/` `pnpm run verify` pipelines pass (lint, format, build, unit, boundary, integration, e2e). Relay-Step-Status: pass\n- 2026-09-17 17:02Z — Relay BB run pushed an update. Pull request: #429 Tokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000 No remaining changes to commit — the working tree was already clean, and the branch `bb/relay-219-implementation-audit-fixes-17-23-imple-thr_tb6kwqv39b` is confirmed pushed and up to date with origin (latest commit `e942392`, which addressed the TOCTOU/patchDatabase/DELETE-staleness review findings). Both `pnpm run verify` runs (backend and web) pass at this commit. Relay-Step-Status: pass\n- 2026-09-17 17:22Z — Relay BB run pushed an update. Pull request: #429 Tokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000 No remaining changes to commit — working tree is clean. Confirmed the branch `bb/relay-219-implementation-audit-fixes-17-23-imple-thr_tb6kwqv39b` is pushed and up to date with origin at commit `e942392`. Both `pnpm run verify` runs (backend and web) pass, and the automated AC-verification confirmed all 41/41 criteria met with zero open review findings. Relay-Step-Status: pass\n- 2026-09-17 17:51Z — Relay BB run pushed an update. Pull request: #429 Tokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000 Pushed successfully. No uncommitted changes remained — commit `b2e5445` (the `optionalIntegerQueryParam` int4-range-validation fix) was pushed to the existing branch `bb/relay-219-implementation-audit-fixes-17-23-imple-thr_tb6kwqv39b`, updating `e942392..b2e5445`. Both `pnpm run verify` runs (backend and web) pass at this commit. Relay-Step-Status: pass\n- 2026-09-17 18:00Z — Relay BB run is blocked and needs manual follow-up — it will not be retried automatically. Reason: code-review check \"code-review\" kept reporting its own infrastructure failure after 3 rerun attempt(s) — manual follow-up needed: https://github.com/dvdtrsnk/semprec/runs/105317299549 Pushed successfully. No uncommitted changes remained — commit `b2e5445` (the `optionalIntegerQueryParam` int4-range-validation fix) was pushed to the existing branch `bb/relay-219-implementation-audit-fixes-17-23-imple-thr_tb6kwqv39b`, updating `e942392..b2e5445`. Both `pnpm run verify` runs (backend and web) pass at this commit. Relay-Step-Status: pass Remove the `agent:blocked` label from this issue once it's addressed to let Relay pick it up again.",
